  "description": "CaveSystems IO Library.\n\t\t\tThis package contains:\n\t\t\t* Fast non-buffering data readers and writers.\n\t\t\t* Endian conversion utilities.\n\t\t\t* FIFO and ring buffer stream implementations.\n\t\t\t* High‑performance struct marshalling.\n\t\t\t* INI (settings) readers and writers.\n\t\t\t* BinarySerializer for lightweight object serialization.\n\t\t\t* BlobSerializer framework for advanced, version‑resilient binary serialization\n\t\t\t(reflection-based converters, custom converters, dictionary/enumerable support).",
